---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Jiafu JF-600 Drill-Tap Machining Center | 600x420x330mm | Eternal CNC" description="Larger-format drill-tap center with 600 x 420 x 330 mm travel and roller linear guides, ideal for mid-size precision parts and automotive component processing.">

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem 2rem;">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--brand-red);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">Drill-Tap Center</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-dark);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1rem;">Jiafu JF-600</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--text-body);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.6;">Larger-format drill-tap center with 600 x 420 x 330 mm travel and roller linear guides, ideal for mid-size precision parts and automotive component processing.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;">BT30 20,000 rpm</span>
        <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:var(--page-bg);color:var(--brand-dark);font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;">600 mm Travel</span>
        <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:var(--page-bg);color:var(--brand-dark);font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;">21 Servo Tools</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--border-color);padding-left:2rem;">
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--brand-red);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.8rem;text-align:right;">钻攻中心</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:2.2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-dark);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:right;">佳富 JF-600</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--text-body);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.6;text-align:right;">大行程钻攻中心，600 x 420 x 330 mm 行程配滚柱线轨，适合中等精密零件及汽车零部件加工。</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;">
        <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;">BT30 20000 转</span>
        <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:var(--page-bg);color:var(--brand-dark);font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;">600 mm 行程</span>
        <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:var(--page-bg);color:var(--brand-dark);font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:4px;">21 把伺服刀库</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Hero Image -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem 3rem;">
  <div style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background-color:var(--page-bg);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
    <img src="/images/equipment/equipment-jiafu-jf600-hero.webp" alt="Jiafu JF-600 CNC drill-tap machining center at Eternal CNC factory" width="1200" height="600" loading="eager" decoding="async" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;object-fit:cover;" />
  </div>
  <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);text-align:center;margin-top:0.8rem;">Representative unit of Jiafu JF-600 · Multiple units in our family network</p>
</section>

<!-- Narrative -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem;">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1rem;">Overview</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">The Jiafu JF-600 steps up from the JF-500 with a larger 600 x 420 x 330 mm work envelope and roller linear guideways for increased rigidity. Its BT30 direct-drive 20,000 rpm spindle and 21-tool servo magazine deliver high productivity for mid-size precision parts and automotive components.</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;">With a 3,800 kg machine weight and stable casting structure, the JF-600 maintains consistent accuracy during extended production runs. It operates as part of our associated shop network, adding scalable capacity for mid-size drill-tap-mill projects.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:right;">设备概述</h2>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:0.8rem;text-align:right;">佳富 JF-600 在 JF-500 基础上升级，600 x 420 x 330 mm 更大行程配滚柱线轨，刚性更强。BT30 直结式 20000 转主轴搭配 21 把伺服刀库，中等精密零件及汽车零部件加工效率高。</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;text-align:right;">JF-600 整机重达 3800 kg，铸铁结构稳定，长时间生产中精度保持一致。作为集团协作产能网络的一员，为中等尺寸钻攻铣项目提供可扩展产能。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Spec Table -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem 3rem;">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1.2rem;">Technical Specifications</h2>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;">Travel (X / Y / Z)</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);">600 / 420 / 330 mm</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--page-bg);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">Worktable</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">720 x 400 mm</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">Spindle</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">BT30, direct-drive 20,000 rpm</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--page-bg);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">Tool Magazine</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">21 tools, servo-type</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">Rapid Traverse</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">60,000 mm/min (roller linear guide)</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--page-bg);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">Machine Weight</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">~3,800 kg</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">Serial No.</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">861306101</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1.2rem;text-align:right;">技术参数</h2>
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;">行程（X / Y / Z）</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;">600 / 420 / 330 mm</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--page-bg);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">工作台</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">720 x 400 mm</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">主轴</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">BT30 直结式，20,000 rpm</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--page-bg);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">刀库容量</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">21 把，伺服式</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">快速移动</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">60,000 mm/min（滚柱线轨）</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--page-bg);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">机床重量</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">约 3,800 kg</td></tr>
          <tr style="background-color:var(--card-white);"><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-dark);width:40%;text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">机械编号</td><td style="padding:0.8rem 1rem;color:var(--text-body);text-align:right;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);">861306101</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Highlights -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem 3rem;background-color:var(--page-bg);">
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1.2rem;">Why This Machine</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Larger Working Envelope</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">600 mm X-travel handles mid-size parts that smaller drill-tap machines cannot accommodate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Roller Linear Guideways</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">Roller-type linear guides provide higher rigidity and load capacity than ball-type guides.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Direct-Drive BT30 Spindle</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">20,000 rpm direct-drive spindle delivers smooth cutting and excellent surface quality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">21-Tool Servo Magazine</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">Ample tool capacity supports complex multi-operation parts in a single setup.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">60k mm/min Rapid Traverse</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">Fast positioning reduces idle time, especially for parts with many dispersed features.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">Heavy Cast Iron Base</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">3,800 kg machine weight with ribbed casting ensures vibration damping and long-term accuracy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1.2rem;text-align:right;">设备亮点</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row-reverse;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div style="text-align:right;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">更大加工范围</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">600 mm X 轴行程，可加工小型钻攻机无法容纳的中等尺寸零件。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row-reverse;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div style="text-align:right;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">滚柱线轨</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">滚柱式线轨比滚珠式刚性更高、承载能力更强。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row-reverse;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div style="text-align:right;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">直结式 BT30 主轴</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">20000 rpm 直结主轴，切削平稳，表面质量优异。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row-reverse;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div style="text-align:right;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">21 把伺服刀库</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">充足刀位支持复杂多工序零件一次装夹完成。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row-reverse;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div style="text-align:right;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">6 万米/分快移</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">快速定位减少空程时间，特征分散的零件优势更明显。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.8rem;align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row-reverse;">
          <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background-color:var(--brand-red);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;">+</div>
          <div style="text-align:right;">
            <h4 style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:0.2rem;">重型铸铁底座</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.5;">3800 kg 筋板铸铁床身，减振效果好，长期精度保持性佳。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Nameplate -->
<section style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem;">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1rem;">Verified Equipment / 铭牌验证</h3>
    <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-body);margin-bottom:1.2rem;line-height:1.6;">This page features a representative Jiafu JF-600 unit from our family workshop. The machine nameplate confirms the model and build record, ensuring full traceability for your project.</p>
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background-color:var(--card-white);">
      <img src="/images/equipment/cnc-machine-jiafu-jf600-drill-tap-machining-center-01.webp" alt="Representative nameplate of Jiafu JF-600" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;" />
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:0.8rem;">Representative nameplate of Jiafu JF-600 · 佳富 JF-600 代表铭牌</p>
  </div>
</section>

